         "comprehends": [
          "copies/ws749sk4778.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Ink, one sloping line of five figures with no separators, read 15.8.25 on the corpus convention. The third figure is the 8 of these hands: under threshold it resolves into an upper narrow loop and a lower bowl joined at a crossing node, not the single stroke of a 6. If it were a 6 the month would be June instead."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
